WEBVTT

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:06.760
In an operation
planned by Captain Bright Noa,

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.760
the Garencieres
successfully rescues Mineva and Marida

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.090
from Martha Carbine's clutches.

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:15.840
However, it suffers engine trouble
on its way back into space.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:20.510
At that moment, the Unicorn Gundam is
enveloped in a never before seen light,

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.090
and saves the ship from danger.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:26.300
However, the Federation Forces have
already dispatched the General Revil fleet

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.970
to intercept them.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:32.590
Full Frontal of the Sleeves,
who is pursuing Laplace's Box,

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:35.180
pushes back the Federation fleet.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:42.380
Now we can talk for a while,
key to the Box... Banagher Links.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:45.840
Banagher, who's been concealing
the Box's final coordinates,

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:49.130
is reunited with Mineva
and makes an important decision.

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:51.380
But still, that man, Cardeas Vist,

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:53.630
wanted Laplace's Box
to be opened anyway.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:56.970
I want to believe, too.
In people's good intentions.

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:32.260
(THE SIDE CO-PROSPERITY SPHERE)

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:39.680
They say the Garencieres
has been destroyed.

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:41.050
I see...

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:45.300
Too bad, I was finally
getting used to the controls

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:48.260
to the point where I felt like
I could fill Gilboa's shoes.

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:52.720
Somehow or other, this gal
fit in about the Garencieres, too.

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:56.470
How many years has it been since
you pulled her out of that cesspool?

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:59.840
At this point, she means
more to us than our own real...

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:40.430
I'd planned to wait
for a chance to hijack

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:43.380
the Federation ship once we got aboard.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:48.010
But I don't care about that anymore.

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:54.840
If you're alive... If you're alive,
that's all that matters.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:07.010
Make sure to double-check the coolant
on the suits berthed on the hangar deck.

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:10.720
Regarding maintenance work
on our own mobile suits,

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:13.430
all crews are to follow
original work schedules.

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:16.300
The inside of the ship
is newer than I expected.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.550
Our intel says
that she was refitted.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:22.340
Still, standing the mobile suits
on the floor like this...

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:25.680
That's something that people whose souls
are bound by gravity would think up.

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:31.470
Hangar Control to all crews
working on the hangar deck.

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:35.590
Connection of Neo Zeon mobile suits
to shipboard power

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:38.050
has been approved by the Captain.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:43.090
If requested, be flexible and provide
power from nearest appropriate station.

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:52.630
The funnels are all gone.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:56.630
With all its add-ons gone, too,
it's pretty much unarmed now.

00:04:56.680 --> 00:05:00.010
I have some ideas for
the Unicorn Gundam, though.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:05.590
The Unicorn has the data for all
the battles since Industrial 7, right?

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:08.470
I'll analyze that and work my magic- -

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:09.930
Hey, Banagher?

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:16.550
With all that's happening,

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:20.590
I have no idea who the Unicorn's
gonna be fighting after we beef it up...

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.010
Mr. Takuya.

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:26.130
How is Ms. Micott doing?

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:29.050
I haven't seen her
since we came aboard.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:33.010
Oh, she's running errands
for Mr. Gibney in the engine room.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.930
She's been more and more on edge
since all this started, you know?

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:43.130
And you, Takuya?
Are you holding up okay?

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:45.760
I'm... getting by.

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:47.380
What about you?

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:50.340
You know the coordinates
to Laplace's Box already, right?

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:56.880
You can't keep them hidden forever.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:59.680
Those Sleeves guys are
behaving themselves for now, but...

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:02.720
Bridge, there's a situation
in the engine room!

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:04.720
No, make that an emergency!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.010
I'm not moving from this spot!

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:08.630
You'll get in over my dead body!

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:11.840
What's going on?

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:13.470
It's Chief Engineer Sydow, he's- -

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:15.760
Commander Liam,
I've had all I can take!

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:18.260
Get these people off our ship!

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:24.050
I don't remember us
handing this ship over to Neo Zeon!

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:25.760
Chief Sydow...

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:31.510
We feel the same way.

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:36.220
Yeah! You can't possibly approve
of this situation, Commander!

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:41.010
The General Revil was going to
destroy us. For now, this is our only- -

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:44.010
And that's why you're letting
Neo Zeon occupy the ship?

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:48.300
I won't feed my men that "The enemy
of my enemy is my friend" nonsense!

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:52.300
Those people are strutting around
the Nahel Argama like they own it!

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:55.260
They even told me to let them
station troops in the engine room!

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:03.970
In the name of our fallen comrades,
we can't consent to this!

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:07.050
You Neo Zeon, get off our ship!

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:13.590
What's all this?

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:17.470
If you were gonna go at it,
you should've said something to us!

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:18.760
Lt. Commander Conroy.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:21.090
Yeah, you ECOAS boys
should help, too!

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:24.840
Your commander and a lot of your team
were killed by these people, right?!

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.680
You've made your feelings quite clear,

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:31.090
but if we refuse to leave,
what are you going to do about it?

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.630
Then we'll throw you off
by force if we have to!

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:37.800
Under the pretext of defending us, you
downed a lot of Federation mobile suits!

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:40.260
What we defended was the Box's key.

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:43.050
We couldn't care less
what happens to you.

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:50.590
It's a fact that you saved us in our
time of need, and I'm grateful for that.

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:53.720
But I just can't bring myself to
welcome you people with open arms,

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:55.550
not when you've killed
so many of our own!

00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:58.090
The feeling is mutual, I assure you.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.720
Angelo.

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:08.550
I won't tolerate any rash behavior.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.970
If any offense was given, I apologize.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:19.590
For the time being, we must
rely on one another to survive.

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:21.930
Please calm down, everyone.

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:25.720
What did you do down on Earth?

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:27.930
The situation's only gotten worse.

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:32.720
Is this the "vitally important" thing
you said that only you can do?

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:43.220
This is the Captain speaking.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:45.340
Whatever you're doing, listen up.

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:48.840
As you know, we have been
caught in the middle

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.760
of a conspiracy involving Laplace's Box

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:54.510
and are now on the run from none other
than the Earth Federation Forces.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:59.090
This joint front was our only option
to extricate ourselves

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:02.380
from the unfair situation
we have found ourselves in.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.090
We have not surrendered.

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:08.880
And the Neo Zeon have no intention
of occupying this vessel.

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:13.090
In order to survive, we must work
together with them for the time being.

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:17.260
I expect you all to conduct
yourselves with restraint.

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:19.260
That is all.

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:25.760
Well, you heard the man.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.210
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:42.340
In spite of what I just said,
it goes without saying

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:44.510
that I have no intention
of siding with Zeon.

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:47.090
Even if that means being
fired upon by my own forces.

00:09:47.510 --> 00:09:51.050
I'll be damned if I let you people
get your hands on Laplace's Box

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:54.090
and have the Earth Sphere
be thrown into chaos again.

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:57.670
Nevertheless, this ship has
no other means of survival.

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:02.510
Thanks to the decoy
provided by the Garencieres,

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:06.090
the Ra Cailum is probably
in the Luna II area by now.

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:09.460
By the time they've turned around
and can rendezvous with you,

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:11.840
we'll have reached our destination.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:15.510
Our destination... Smack dab in
the middle of a shoal zone?

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:20.380
This shoal zone, all that remains
of the Battle of Loum...

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:25.460
If the idea is to make us follow
the trail of mankind's conflicts

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:28.460
to convey the significance
of obtaining the Box,

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:33.550
it would not be surprising
if the final point were set there.

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:37.550
You people been intercepting the
data from the Unicorn, haven't you?

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:40.630
Don't you already know
the exact coordinates?

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:43.460
We know that it is in the shoal zone.

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:46.460
But we weren't able to intercept
anything beyond that.

00:10:46.510 --> 00:10:47.460
Why not?

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:50.590
Because the Unicorn
wouldn't let us, I expect.

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:53.460
Since finding its pilot in Banagher,

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:57.420
it seems to be exhibiting abilities that
weren't in its original specifications.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:04.710
For now, let's focus on obtaining
Laplace's Box, shall we?

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:10.590
The Box will be a trump card
that will prolong your lives, as well.

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:14.130
I expect that Banagher
understands that. Sooner or- -

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:17.760
What about you? What do you hope
to do with the Box once you have it?

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:23.630
I doubt that a man they call
the Second Coming of Char

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:25.630
simply wants to revive Zeon.

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:29.550
I think it's about time that you
revealed what your true intentions are.

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:32.260
I want to hear this, as well.

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:45.550
Let's hear it, Captain Full Frontal.

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:47.710
What are you really after?

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:50.130
As you wish.

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:09.340
Do you mind?

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:12.130
Not at all.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:17.170
What we Spacenoids desire,
first and foremost,

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:19.380
is the establishment
of our right to self-rule.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:22.670
The Federation will never
consent to this.

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:25.630
They know that the instant they do,

00:12:25.670 --> 00:12:28.300
the roles of master and servant
would be reversed.

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:31.170
The reason is obvious.

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:34.210
At present, life in the
Earth Sphere depends on

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:37.420
the existence of the
seven Sides and the moon,

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:41.010
including energy production, food
production, economic activity itself.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:45.300
The fact is that on its own,
the planet Earth is no longer

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:48.710
even capable of feeding
2 billion Earthnoid mouths.

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:51.550
Spacenoids, on the other hand,

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:55.710
could easily support themselves
if they were to sever ties with Earth.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:01.590
Zeon Deikun should have
used this fact as a weapon.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.800
However, while he may have been
a great philosopher,

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.800
a politician he was not.

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:10.420
Whether it's the Zabi family
twisting Zeon's ideals

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:13.420
and exploiting them
in a war for independence

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:16.800
or the two Neo Zeon wars,
it all boils down to the same thing.

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:21.880
Until we abandon the goal of forcing
them to formally acknowledge us,

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:24.300
there will be no victory in our
battle against the Federation.

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:27.760
We will strengthen the ties
between the moon and seven Sides

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:31.260
and create an economic zone
that excludes the Earth at its center.

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:34.420
That is to say, we found
the Side Co-Prosperity Sphere.

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:35.710
That makes sense.

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:40.880
If all the Sides enter into an economic
partnership and boycott Earth,

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:44.840
it will wither away into a backwater
with no economic value whatsoever.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:47.460
The Federation Government probably
won't be able to survive, either.

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:51.630
The only entity capable
of acting as mediator for this

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:53.550
is the Republic of Zeon.

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:56.260
Although it may be
a Federation puppet,

00:13:56.300 --> 00:14:00.460
a certain degree of autonomy
has been granted to it.

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:03.920
The problem is that it is set
to relinquish its autonomy

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:06.880
to the Federation in four short years.

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:10.260
If the Republic reverts back to Side 3

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:13.760
and is no longer permitted to act as
anything beyond a local government,

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:17.210
we will never move toward
the Side Co-Prosperity Sphere.

00:14:17.260 --> 00:14:19.380
And it was at that crucial juncture

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:25.010
that the proposal came from the Vist
Foundation to turn over Laplace's Box.

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:31.710
Yes. Although I doubt that Cardeas
Vist was aware of our plans,

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:34.590
judging from the timing of the offer,
I suspect that he hated the idea

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:37.460
that the Federation order
would become more entrenched

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:39.510
when the Republic was dissolved.

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:43.260
It is common knowledge that,
with the dissolution of the Republic,

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:45.920
the Federation intends
to eradicate Zeon.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:48.170
As is embodied by the Unicorn Gundam,

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:51.460
a device designed to destroy
the Newtype myth.

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:55.840
So, what you hope to gain
by obtaining the Box is time.

00:14:56.960 --> 00:15:01.010
By threatening the Federation and
postponing the Republic's dissolution,

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:05.300
you gain time to create this
Side Co-Prosperity Sphere of yours.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.300
That sums it up admirably.

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:13.050
Now that I hear it,
it all seems so petty.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:17.920
You want to create this Side Co-Prosperity
Sphere and leave out the Federation.

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:21.090
Rather than demanding change
from those who refuse it,

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:23.340
you will simply ignore them.

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:25.710
That is far removed from
the ideals of Zeon Deikun,

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:27.300
who dreamed of
reforming humanity.

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:32.260
And worlds apart from the
madness, the passion, of Char,

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:34.510
who tried to render Earth uninhabitable

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:36.510
and bring all humanity into space.

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:38.670
Are you sure this is
what you really want?

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:42.760
If this Side Co-Prosperity Sphere
of yours comes to pass,

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:46.130
the Earthnoids will probably speed up
the redevelopment of Earth.

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:49.960
In order to support
an economy of their own.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.800
It would be a return to the
old A.D. calendar days.

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:57.090
The new generation
that will grow up in poverty

00:15:57.130 --> 00:15:59.920
might even plot to retaliate
against the Spacenoids.

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:04.010
Just like when Zeon
started the One Year War.

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:05.760
There will be no harmony or reform,

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:09.130
only the strong and weak endlessly
trading places into the future.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:13.670
Is that what a man who decided to reveal
himself to the world again really wants?

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:16.130
I can imagine how
you must feel, Highness.

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:20.010
It is not a matter of right or wrong.

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:22.710
It is simply the way of the world.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:26.630
A vessel does not think.

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:30.550
It simply acts in accordance with the
collective will it has been filled with.

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:33.050
In order to ensure humanity's
continued survival.

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:39.550
You talk like it doesn't affect you.

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:42.590
Even though you're talking about
your own people's future,

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:45.800
what you're saying sounds cold and
detached, like it doesn't involve you.

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:58.300
That light that enveloped
the Unicorn Gundam...

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:00.760
It was warm.

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:05.420
Like it was the combined feelings
of everyone I know.

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:08.380
If that kind of possibility
is inside humans, then...

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:11.760
I've seen that same light before.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.050
A light that was even larger.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:19.590
A light that may have been
the result of the subconscious

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:22.380
of every human in the Earth Sphere

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:25.840
being gathered via the psycho-frame
and converted into kinetic energy.

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:29.920
A psycho-field that deflected
the asteroid Axis.

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:33.010
The Axis Shock...

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:37.460
And yet, even when confronted
with possibility of such magnitude,

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:38.880
people did not change.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:43.130
To maintain the status quo, they will
sweep even possibility under the rug.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:45.170
It is what humans do.

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:50.090
All we can do is hope to find peace
and stability within our reality.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:54.420
You should be aware that
this "possibility" of yours

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:57.090
has been known to be
a poison that causes wars.

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:08.010
The Char Aznable that I knew
truly is dead, isn't he?

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:16.130
Industrial 7.
Its colony builder, Magallanica.

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:22.550
That is the final set of coordinates
given by the La+ program.

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:38.090
It's a burden too heavy
for that boy to bear.

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:42.550
I'd like you to confirm this, Banagher.

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:48.090
I'm going back to
the Rewloola for a bit.

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:50.170
I'd like you to come with me, Captain.

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:52.210
You're in charge here, Angelo.

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:54.800
Yes, sir!

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:30.960
When it comes to keeping the Neo Zeon
from getting their hands on the Box,

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:33.880
the Vist Foundation and
Federation Government's interests

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:35.840
are completely aligned.

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:37.670
In the face of that threat,

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:41.090
the continued existence of the Box
is no longer of vital importance.

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:45.670
The Banshee is a machine that was
originally built for Cyber-Newtypes.

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:48.340
Banagher has mastered his.

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:50.670
I'll do the same.

00:19:52.380 --> 00:19:54.090
One more thing.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:59.170
If at all possible, I'd like you
to recover the Cyber-Newtype,

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:02.170
Ple Twelve, who was
abducted by the Sleeves.

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:05.260
As to why... I'll leave that
to your imagination.

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:10.590
But the reason I went to such lengths to
recommend you as the Banshee's pilot

00:20:10.630 --> 00:20:13.090
is because I believe
I can trust you to do this

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:15.760
without informing my aunt
or her people.

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:19.630
If you are unable to destroy the
Unicorn even with the Banshee,

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:22.840
the Vist Foundation will be
forced to use its final option.

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:26.130
Should that happen,
everything will be lost.

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:29.840
I doubt you want that either, Ensign.

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:33.340
That would mean killing
your half-brother.

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:34.880
Are you all right with that?

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:39.130
We're already traveling down
a bloody road.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:44.090
It was an accident...
No, I suppose it wasn't.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:52.760
My family members, the Vists,
have a history of killing each other.

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:57.710
The reason my aunt, Martha, became
so stubborn is because her father,

00:20:57.760 --> 00:21:00.010
that is, my grandfather,

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:03.300
was killed by Syam Vist,
my great-grandfather.

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:07.340
Revenge against a world
ruled by the logic of men.

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:11.840
It's not something that a man
can easily accept,

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:17.260
but perhaps this world ought
to be wiped clean for once.

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:50.090
Though a species that creates demons
like the Unicorn and Banshee

00:21:50.130 --> 00:21:53.670
is probably standing at the
threshold of destruction already.

00:23:38.300 --> 00:23:41.590
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.630 --> 00:23:44.340
NAHEL ARGAMA RECAPTURED

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:48.380
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
